    API --> MOB["Mobile web app / PWA (phone)"]
    CON --> AN["Analyst"]
    MOB --> AN
    AN -->|"Contain (tap)"| RSP["Simulated containment + re-evaluation"]
    RSP -->|"new state"| P
```

